      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Esquilo Elétrico. Pachirisu armazena eletricidade nas bolsas de suas bochechas e a libera pela cauda. Dois deles às vezes esfregam as bolsas faciais para compartilhar energia.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 6 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Fada, Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/1</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Pachirisu não possui evoluções conhecidas.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Bide, Growl, Thunder Shock</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Quick Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Charm</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Spark</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Endure</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Nuzzle, Swift</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Electro Ball</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Sweet Kiss</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Thunder Wave</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Super Fang</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Discharge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Hyper Fang, Last Resort, Thunder</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Agility, Alluring Voice, Attract, Baby-Doll Eyes, Charge, Charge Beam, Charm, Confide, Covet, Dig, Double Team, Echoed Voice, Eerie Impulse, Electric Terrain, Electro Ball, Electroweb, Encore, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Fake Tears, Fling, Frustration, Giga Impact, Grass Knot, Gunk Shot, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Beam, Iron Tail, Laser Focus, Last Resort, Light Screen, Magnet Rise, Mud Shot, Mud- Slap, Play Rough, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Round, Seed Bomb, Shock Wave, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Sunny Day, Super Fang, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder, Thunder Fang, Thunder Punch, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Trailblaze, U-turn, Uproar, Volt Switch, Wild Charge</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Baby-Doll Eyes, Bestow, Bite, Charge, Covet, Defense Curl, Fake Tears, Flail, Flatter, Follow Me, Ion Deluge, Iron Tail, Rollout, Tail Whip</p>",
